WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.620
Release group MANIA presents

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.620
http://doramamania.mybb.ru

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.620
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.470
Episode 17

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:21.860
You said that as long as we are together, you don't need to be an emperor

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.430
Don't you say that anymore

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.330
We agreed not to lie to each other

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:35.630
I started this, I have to stop the brothers from killing each other

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.170
But...

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:48.520
Project coordinator, editor, typesetter and song translator: Nemie

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:41.570
When I was building the palace,

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:47.080
I realized that the world can change if the ruler who rules it changes

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:58.620
Translators: Nemie, tamaramin, Kaia

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:54.670
I don't want to be controlled

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.800
And I can get rid of all this absurdity

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:08.720
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:00.580
Become an emperor -

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.300
what I want

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.700
What? Don't you want me to become emperor?

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.030
I don't like it

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.290
But most of all I don't like being away from you

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:26.520
Thank you

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:31.310
You will become the emperor

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:34.010
I know

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.890
But you should never...

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.620
Brothers should never be killed

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.950
Can you promise?

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:12.380
March 949

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:13.270
This is Prince Wang So!

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:14.860
The army is approaching!

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:16.490
Close the palace gates!

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:42.240
Are you...hiding something from me?

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.420
Did you poison the tea or something?

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:46.710
No, Your Majesty

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.240
The court lady has already checked it

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:56.360
Now, being in this state, I thought about everything

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.400
and realized that it all started with you

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:05.740
What?

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:09.560
Older brother, Eun, Eun's wife

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.190
Even the late emperor

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:17.030
All these dead people are getting to me

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.550
It's your fault

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:27.270
I decided to kill my brothers and become emperor

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:30.860
All because of you...

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:36.360
You helped Seo hide his scar so he could take my place.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:40.460
Because he took what belonged to me...

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.560
Your Majesty!

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.110
Yo!

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.900
It's So! So is heading to the palace!

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:12.430
Wang So... started a rebellion!

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.500
Yo, Yo...

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.550
Write quickly

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.070
Write that you are transferring the throne to Jeong

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:33.180
Rather

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:36.570
What?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.730
We can't lose our throne

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.320
Rather. Write that Jeong will become the new emperor

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.930
Then we can plan for the future. Come on

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:54.210
But... what about me?

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:00.830
Am I your son?

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.430
Who am I to you, mother?

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.190
Something that should sit on the throne?

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:19.660
You no longer need a son who has ceased to be an emperor?!

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.980
Yo, don't be like that

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.380
We'll lose everything if you behave like this.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.460
Please give it to Jeong

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:37.760
Now I think I understand So

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.090
I can understand his feelings

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:45.900
Bring out the Empress Dowager!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.670
Yo

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:52.110
Yo, don't do this! Yo! Yo!

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:55.260
Yo! Let me go! Release immediately!

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:56.900
Let go. Yo!

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:58.440
Yo!

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.940
Let go! Let me in! Yo!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.010
I can't find my brother

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.070
Park Soo Kyung and Seo...

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:37.810
The palace guards won't last long...

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:42.100
Mother?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.810
Whatever you decide, I will go with you

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.430
I realized this when I saw your brother

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.370
I realized that I forgot to teach you

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:03.190
If you want to become the owner of a palace, you need to sacrifice something

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:06.630
Mother

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:07.950
Decide for yourself

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:11.120
You can take over the whole world, but lose love

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.870
You can love, but live in a very small world

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:21.920
What if I want the whole world?

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:31.570
I... will give up Uka

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:52.930
I will attack the palace that I have always defended

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:37.450
I will help you enter the palace without bloodshed

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.750
I won't forget your loyalty

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:00.470
I knew that in the end he would get everything

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:09.340
What did I... do wrong?

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:14.190
I was afraid that they would get rid of me too

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:17.150
Like from So

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:19.510
I thought they would turn away from me

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.710
Mother told me

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:37.040
She said I have no flaws

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:39.980
But...

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:47.720
It's all because of you, girl!

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.410
Because of your interference!

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:58.620
You must choose

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:12.080
Who should I give the throne to?

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:14.690
Choose

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.460
Uku?

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.780
Baek A or So?!

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:24.320
You're so experienced, why don't you choose?

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.070
Find the Emperor! Alive!

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:33.150
- Eat!
- Eat!

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:27.220
I just

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.440
tried to survive

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:25.160
Have you read this?

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.530
To the side!

00:12:58.530 --> 00:13:00.930
Get away, I say! Away!

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:22.280
Yo...

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:45.300
Hail the new emperor

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:49.260
Long live... Long live...

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.360
emperor

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.430
What does "emperor" mean?

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:05.740
What does it mean?

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:10.400
His Majesty gave me the throne before his death

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:17.620
He handed it to me

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.340
What?

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:27.060
Greetings, Your Majesty

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:30.030
- Hail to the Emperor
- Hail to the Emperor

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:33.710
- Long live the emperor!
- Long live the emperor!

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:35.330
His Imperial Majesty!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:39.100
- Long live the emperor!
- Long live the emperor!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.380
His Imperial Majesty!

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:47.700
- Long live the emperor!
- Long live the emperor!

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.610
Gwangjong

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:07.850
He is the 4th Emperor of Goryeo

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.280
Gwangjong

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:16.630
Now you won't be recorded
in history as a "bloody ruler"

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.200
I will help you

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:31.300
Now our Hwangbo clan is using
its power to promote the empress

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:36.410
It makes me sad to see how much you've changed

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:39.440
The more you go astray, the more you will suffer

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:43.210
It's better for you to distance yourself from the imperial family

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.960
Why didn't you come to the coronation?

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:56.250
What if people don't think so?

00:16:56.250 --> 00:17:02.360
When I arrived in Seogyeong, Wang Sik Ryeom was already dead.

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:08.370
I immediately sent a message asking to find the 4th Prince's people,

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:11.660
but the owner of the throne has already changed

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:17.530
The rebel who breaks the one who committed treason becomes a hero

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:23.570
I wanted this place, but Wang So took it

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:28.200
You wanted me to see this

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:31.010
Isn't this too cruel?

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:37.060
Help me

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:42.050
I will become an empress and thank you for the pain you went through.

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:46.220
I will take away part of your burden that you have been coping with alone for so long

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:51.530
Give me strength, brother. Please

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:10.970
Change of capital...

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.430
Issue an imperial decree that the change of capital will be stopped immediately

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:23.970
All people forced into construction

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:28.050
will receive payment in accordance with the duration of their work, everyone will return home

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:31.950
What about those who died?

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.120
Do what their families ask

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:41.300
Promise them jobs, compensate them with goods

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:45.920
Then... have we discussed everything for today?

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:46.600
Yes

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.200
Your Majesty,

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:51.470
Courtier Hae from Damiwon is waiting for you

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:52.740
Hae Soo?

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:09.730
I only remember your smell and your laughter

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:16.180
I'm always waiting only for you, counting the days

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:21.380
And it doesn’t matter where I am now, because only you are in my thoughts

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:27.580
What I dreamed about and what I wanted

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:32.180
Do you know what? Don't you know yet

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:30.610
Su

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:37.280
I just want to meet you

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:43.080
Yes, I want to admit that I'm waiting for you

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.120
Have you come?

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:49.380
And every day I can shout “I love you,” so what?

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:54.450
And every day I can call you

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:55.070
How long did you wait? I'm sorry

00:19:54.450 --> 00:20:00.890
My heart is trembling so much, will you hear it?

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:58.310
Here...

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:02.840
Now, you like this, right?

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:06.240
I love, I love, I love

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:06.100
Thank you very much, Your Majesty

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.500
What are you doing? Everyone's here

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.140
Call me brother

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:14.770
I don’t know about others, but you can

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.020
Yes, Your Majesty

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:18.680
"Your Majesty" again?

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:36.930
Thank you very much, Your Majesty!

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.770
Sit down, sit down

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:55.280
Great, I really like it

00:20:55.750 --> 00:21:00.420
I was so looking forward to you and I having dinner together,

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:02.320
like a family

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.520
Yes, we understand, please eat

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:06.530
If you talk to me on an empty stomach,

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:09.230
I won't eat with you anymore

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:15.370
Okay, let's get started

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:51.300
Su!

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:06.650
I thought you were gone

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:13.290
I'll leave when you fall asleep

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:16.220
It's been a long day

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.810
Why go back and forth?

00:22:30.810 --> 00:22:33.250
Just sleep with me

00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:46.270
Because I'm next to you, I'm very happy

00:22:47.290 --> 00:22:53.890
Because I'm next to you, I keep dreaming

00:22:53.820 --> 00:22:55.000
What?

00:22:54.870 --> 00:23:02.510
Because I'm next to you, I smile so brightly

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:56.940
You have become an emperor

00:22:56.940 --> 00:22:59.370
I don't want bad rumors to start

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:01.540
I'll be back tomorrow

00:23:02.510 --> 00:23:08.390
For you to be mine, I always pray to the Gods

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:10.750
I need you here

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:16.790
If you see my love and my feelings

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:14.650
I feel uneasy here

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:16.950
Perhaps because he saw the death of the previous owner of the chambers?

00:23:17.820 --> 00:23:24.690
If you find my love and the path to me

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:22.630
Thoughts that I will be here alone

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:26.930
suffocating me from the inside

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:33.870
I will give my heart completely

00:23:27.250 --> 00:23:29.770
Stay, eh?

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:33.800
Stay with me

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:44.770
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:47.690
Can you tell me a story?

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:50.690
We're not very far from a thousand

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:58.530
You won't see stars from here

00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:01.430
Maybe tell a story about you?

00:24:02.630 --> 00:24:05.700
About me?

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:11.810
The big and terrible wolf ate a girl named Little Red Riding Hood

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:19.900
I want to love you like my last love

00:24:16.280 --> 00:24:18.580
Once upon a time

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:23.160
Once upon a time there was a cute little girl

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:27.780
If only everything were like this, then life would be happy

00:24:23.160 --> 00:24:25.690
with big eyes,

00:24:25.690 --> 00:24:27.990
Mom sent her to take it to her grandmother...

00:24:28.310 --> 00:24:36.860
I will give my heart completely

00:24:36.860 --> 00:24:46.560
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:24:50.960 --> 00:24:55.160
I'm with you

00:24:59.090 --> 00:25:03.860
All with you

00:25:11.320 --> 00:25:13.740
Even after just a day

00:25:14.040 --> 00:25:17.380
I realized how naive I was

00:25:17.690 --> 00:25:21.720
It's hard to wait for him, even though I want him to become emperor

00:25:21.720 --> 00:25:25.020
However, I think I can wait even longer

00:25:25.020 --> 00:25:27.250
Be careful with words like that

00:25:28.340 --> 00:25:31.930
The Emperor is married to Princess Gyeong-hwa, but she will become a priestess

00:25:31.930 --> 00:25:34.130
The empress's seat is still empty

00:25:35.280 --> 00:25:38.730
People will be watching you closely, so be careful.

00:25:39.950 --> 00:25:42.770
Senior courtier! Senior courtier!

00:25:42.770 --> 00:25:43.970
Chae Ryung, you...

00:25:48.480 --> 00:25:51.900
Concubine He, Empress Dowager Yu wants to see you

00:26:15.380 --> 00:26:17.140
Greetings, Your Majesty

00:26:17.140 --> 00:26:19.420
I called you because I have a question

00:26:22.210 --> 00:26:23.270
Jeong

00:26:25.330 --> 00:26:28.160
This was found in the room of the late emperor

00:26:29.400 --> 00:26:31.790
It seems like this is his last decree

00:26:33.890 --> 00:26:36.420
I'm sure we're talking about the transfer of the throne

00:26:37.270 --> 00:26:42.170
If so, it may not be So's name listed here

00:26:44.360 --> 00:26:45.500
Tell me

00:26:46.340 --> 00:26:49.810
Did the late emperor really want to hand over the throne to So?

00:26:53.060 --> 00:26:56.670
Don't be afraid, we will protect you

00:26:56.980 --> 00:26:58.480
You just need to be honest

00:27:00.430 --> 00:27:05.960
Is it true that the late emperor wanted to hand over the throne to So?

00:27:12.370 --> 00:27:13.840
Yes it's true

00:27:13.840 --> 00:27:16.580
Lies, you're lying

00:27:18.390 --> 00:27:19.920
I know Yo

00:27:20.470 --> 00:27:22.950
Nobody knows him better than me

00:27:23.660 --> 00:27:26.250
He would never have handed over the throne to So

00:27:27.750 --> 00:27:30.610
Tell me! Tell the truth!

00:27:30.610 --> 00:27:32.720
- Mom
- Tell me, tell me!

00:27:32.720 --> 00:27:34.740
- Tell!
- Stop!

00:27:48.800 --> 00:27:49.990
That's enough

00:27:50.530 --> 00:27:53.290
You can ask me this, why are you bothering her?

00:27:54.380 --> 00:27:55.450
How's that?

00:27:56.270 --> 00:27:58.420
Then why don't you tell me the truth?

00:27:59.880 --> 00:28:01.640
Why did you tear up the decree?

00:28:01.640 --> 00:28:03.680
Who said it was me who tore it?

00:28:07.570 --> 00:28:11.470
I don't know why Yo tore it
and left only a dying wish

00:28:11.470 --> 00:28:14.160
He handed over the throne to me, there can be no doubt about it

00:28:17.540 --> 00:28:20.920
He has a son. Why should he
handing over the throne to your younger brother?

00:28:21.420 --> 00:28:24.960
If you're so curious, maybe you could ask him in the afterlife?

00:28:25.740 --> 00:28:27.740
It's good that he abdicated the throne

00:28:27.740 --> 00:28:30.480
How would things turn out if we had to seize the throne?

00:28:31.310 --> 00:28:33.180
I think around this time

00:28:33.780 --> 00:28:36.190
the palace would be filled with Jeong's blood,

00:28:36.190 --> 00:28:39.450
my brothers and nephews

00:28:45.720 --> 00:28:50.110
Empress Dowager, why aren't you preparing a memorial service for the late emperor?

00:28:51.430 --> 00:28:53.810
I will visit you more often
inquire about your affairs

00:28:53.810 --> 00:28:55.480
Don't call me Empress Dowager

00:28:57.800 --> 00:29:01.500
I don't want to be called that because you sit on the throne

00:29:01.500 --> 00:29:03.640
But I am also your son, mother

00:29:04.390 --> 00:29:08.790
If your son is an emperor, you become empress dowager

00:29:08.790 --> 00:29:11.980
You are just a thief who stole my son's throne!

00:29:23.760 --> 00:29:28.150
Tell my clan in Jeonju that I want to see them

00:29:40.540 --> 00:29:43.500
You don't have to go anywhere, even if they call you

00:29:44.640 --> 00:29:45.640
Okay

00:29:50.830 --> 00:29:55.570
No matter who it is, no matter what title, you must first get my permission.

00:29:55.570 --> 00:29:56.640
Do you understand?

00:29:56.640 --> 00:29:58.410
I understood

00:30:03.240 --> 00:30:04.260
I...

00:30:20.670 --> 00:30:24.400
Your Majesty, rumors are coming to us from all sides

00:30:24.730 --> 00:30:25.800
What rumors?

00:30:26.950 --> 00:30:29.940
People believe that Gyeong Jong Won Geun should be the emperor

00:30:29.940 --> 00:30:35.070
Foreign Minister Park Yong-gyu thinks you lied about the emperor's dying wish

00:30:37.060 --> 00:30:38.230
Kill

00:30:39.400 --> 00:30:40.480
What?

00:30:40.480 --> 00:30:43.450
Kill everyone who accuses me of treason

00:30:45.770 --> 00:30:47.640
Servants of the late emperor...

00:30:47.640 --> 00:30:51.220
We need to take care of all the court ladies and guards who were in Jeongdeokjeong.

00:30:52.180 --> 00:30:54.220
Don't leave a single person behind

00:30:54.220 --> 00:30:57.190
which casts doubt
my right to inherit the throne

00:31:00.510 --> 00:31:02.320
Don't miss out

00:31:03.590 --> 00:31:05.130
none

00:31:08.170 --> 00:31:11.090
The Emperor is determined to catch me

00:31:11.090 --> 00:31:14.310
It was you who started the rumors that the emperor lied about the dying words of the late emperor

00:31:14.310 --> 00:31:15.740
Did you think you'd be safe?

00:31:15.760 --> 00:31:16.870
What is it?

00:31:17.900 --> 00:31:20.240
Then I better reveal the fact

00:31:20.240 --> 00:31:23.140
that you were spying on the 4th prince and Baek Ah

00:31:23.910 --> 00:31:25.700
Do you think I'll die alone?

00:31:26.390 --> 00:31:27.930
Clueless girl

00:32:00.410 --> 00:32:03.360
I haven't seen this for a long time

00:32:03.360 --> 00:32:05.930
It's gotten pretty dirty, you need a new bag

00:32:08.310 --> 00:32:10.050
I don't want to lose him

00:32:11.670 --> 00:32:13.240
Did you get it from your parents?

00:32:15.650 --> 00:32:19.280
I'll have to do something
whatever your parents don't like

00:32:20.810 --> 00:32:22.190
What is this?

00:32:22.190 --> 00:32:24.150
Before our marriage,

00:32:25.590 --> 00:32:29.990
I think we need to arrange for you
adopted daughter into a good family

00:32:32.410 --> 00:32:37.220
Is it because I'm from Hubaekje?

00:32:37.220 --> 00:32:40.910
My grandmother still remembers what happened in Gyeonghwan

00:32:41.700 --> 00:32:44.000
Her family was killed before her eyes

00:32:44.650 --> 00:32:47.640
She tries to avoid any dealings with people from Hubaekje

00:32:48.820 --> 00:32:51.050
But it happened before we were born

00:32:51.050 --> 00:32:52.980
What does this have to do with you?

00:32:53.030 --> 00:32:55.030
You are Gyung Won's granddaughter

00:32:55.110 --> 00:32:57.750
Still, I would like to avoid unnecessary problems

00:32:58.020 --> 00:33:00.540
I will visit your parents at the cemetery and ask for their forgiveness.

00:33:00.540 --> 00:33:02.320
If someone finds out about your relationship,

00:33:02.320 --> 00:33:04.580
Prince Baek Ah will also be in danger

00:33:04.580 --> 00:33:06.880
Is everything okay?

00:33:08.450 --> 00:33:12.450
Emperor Goryeo killed my parents

00:33:14.850 --> 00:33:20.260
and our king killed yours

00:33:21.160 --> 00:33:26.930
Do you think we can be together?

00:33:27.170 --> 00:33:27.890
Woo Hee

00:33:29.570 --> 00:33:31.570
It's not my fault

00:33:32.500 --> 00:33:34.500
and not yours either

00:33:39.680 --> 00:33:41.980
Think about us

00:33:42.510 --> 00:33:44.810
Until you stop loving me

00:33:44.980 --> 00:33:49.390
we will never be apart from you

00:33:54.320 --> 00:33:55.760
I'm against it

00:33:55.760 --> 00:33:59.670
I want to relax, so I'll go back to my hometown

00:34:00.360 --> 00:34:02.040
I need you more than ever

00:34:03.050 --> 00:34:05.360
I don't understand why you insist on leaving

00:34:08.030 --> 00:34:10.200
To tell the truth...

00:34:11.290 --> 00:34:15.170
I'm incredibly tired of the imperial court

00:34:17.890 --> 00:34:20.380
Every time I walk from side to side...

00:34:21.280 --> 00:34:22.960
My girl...

00:34:24.630 --> 00:34:28.830
I see my girl, I hear her voice

00:34:29.810 --> 00:34:32.700
I try my best to pretend it's not true

00:34:32.700 --> 00:34:38.740
But I can't get rid of your image with a sword in your hands

00:34:40.880 --> 00:34:42.840
It's very difficult

00:34:45.920 --> 00:34:47.190
Don't leave

00:34:48.520 --> 00:34:50.330
- Don't leave
- Your Majesty

00:34:51.050 --> 00:34:53.370
For the sake of this country and its people

00:34:54.700 --> 00:34:56.560
become a good and wise emperor

00:34:57.330 --> 00:34:59.450
You must become one

00:35:21.720 --> 00:35:23.680
Park Soo Kyung left

00:35:25.830 --> 00:35:28.010
He's tired of the palace

00:35:29.740 --> 00:35:31.030
Now he

00:35:33.240 --> 00:35:34.500
afraid of me

00:35:40.870 --> 00:35:44.290
Do you want to know whose name the late emperor wrote in the last decree?

00:35:44.290 --> 00:35:45.740
Right?

00:35:46.820 --> 00:35:50.480
Wondering if I stole this throne or not

00:35:50.480 --> 00:35:52.490
I don't think about it at all

00:35:53.550 --> 00:35:56.860
I'm the least curious about this

00:36:04.610 --> 00:36:05.930
It was empty there

00:36:16.850 --> 00:36:19.250
There was no name there

00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:21.880
Therefore

00:36:23.420 --> 00:36:27.720
I tore up the decree, thinking that it would cause even more confusion

00:36:28.590 --> 00:36:33.120
One way or another, we have already captured the palace

00:36:36.320 --> 00:36:38.320
You did everything right

00:36:38.320 --> 00:36:40.690
Park Soo Kyung left

00:36:41.530 --> 00:36:44.160
Baek Ah sees me only as an emperor,

00:36:44.160 --> 00:36:46.160
not my brother

00:36:47.570 --> 00:36:49.570
For Choi Chi Mon I

00:36:49.830 --> 00:36:53.200
avenger of the death of his older brother

00:36:54.070 --> 00:36:56.770
Jeong...

00:36:57.510 --> 00:37:02.680
sees me as a murderer of my own brothers. That's right,

00:37:03.620 --> 00:37:06.850
even my mother

00:37:07.350 --> 00:37:10.250
thinks I'm a thief

00:37:17.430 --> 00:37:20.160
You were right

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:24.100
Throne

00:37:24.570 --> 00:37:31.270
makes you scared and lonely

00:37:40.690 --> 00:37:42.220
I'm here

00:37:43.260 --> 00:37:51.140
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:37:51.020 --> 00:37:52.880
I won't leave you

00:37:51.360 --> 00:37:57.860
In your eyes, I settled in your gaze

00:37:57.860 --> 00:38:04.240
And I can only answer you:

00:38:05.040 --> 00:38:11.540
Hold me if I'm swinging

00:38:11.540 --> 00:38:14.760
my love

00:38:15.020 --> 00:38:18.450
Wow! This is what Jeongdeokjeong looks like!

00:38:18.710 --> 00:38:22.240
my love

00:38:30.190 --> 00:38:34.870
I have a favor to ask of you, madam.

00:38:38.450 --> 00:38:43.150
By order of the new emperor,
free some court ladies

00:38:44.050 --> 00:38:45.680
Including me

00:38:48.550 --> 00:38:50.860
I was told to leave Damiwon

00:38:52.530 --> 00:38:55.210
I think I won't be able to see you often

00:38:56.020 --> 00:38:57.510
Where will you go?

00:38:59.160 --> 00:39:02.780
Madam, can you help me stay in the palace?

00:39:03.460 --> 00:39:05.740
Please ask the emperor for this

00:39:14.020 --> 00:39:15.150
How did it go?

00:39:15.150 --> 00:39:18.170
She said she would ask the emperor

00:39:19.860 --> 00:39:21.250
Excellent

00:39:21.250 --> 00:39:23.130
You should stay in Damiwon

00:39:25.800 --> 00:39:28.950
But this chance...

00:39:30.610 --> 00:39:32.530
May I come with you, your highness?

00:39:34.000 --> 00:39:36.710
I don't know when else I'll get the chance to leave the palace.

00:39:40.090 --> 00:39:44.130
Chae Ryung, you can still do a lot for me while in the palace.

00:39:45.820 --> 00:39:49.080
When the time comes I'll take you away from here

00:40:02.990 --> 00:40:05.390
A request for independence means

00:40:05.990 --> 00:40:08.530
that Jeonju will no longer be part of Goryeo?

00:40:08.530 --> 00:40:10.530
Your right to the throne is in doubt

00:40:11.040 --> 00:40:13.040
How can we perceive you as an emperor?

00:40:14.170 --> 00:40:17.880
Loyalty comes only from trust

00:40:19.580 --> 00:40:23.480
I am also the grandson of Mr. Yoo Geun Dal

00:40:23.530 --> 00:40:30.520
However, the entire clan is against me, the current emperor?

00:40:32.160 --> 00:40:34.560
You have to consider what other clans will think,

00:40:35.160 --> 00:40:39.960
when even the emperor's clan does not support him

00:40:42.170 --> 00:40:44.470
Do you want

00:40:44.470 --> 00:40:47.940
break our ties, Jeong?

00:40:48.490 --> 00:40:50.670
If the problem with the late emperor's wishes becomes clear,

00:40:51.270 --> 00:40:54.080
we'll find out for sure

00:41:04.860 --> 00:41:07.390
We have to do something about the Yu Clan, otherwise things will get worse

00:41:07.390 --> 00:41:10.590
Or they must show them the last decree of the emperor,

00:41:10.590 --> 00:41:14.530
or enter into an alliance with other powerful clans

00:41:14.830 --> 00:41:17.900
Until the very end

00:41:18.320 --> 00:41:20.170
I'm not her son

00:41:39.460 --> 00:41:41.460
Wu Hee?

00:41:44.930 --> 00:41:47.000
I'm sure the emperor will like it

00:41:47.000 --> 00:41:51.370
Isn't it a small gift compared to the new chambers?

00:41:54.370 --> 00:41:56.670
Su,

00:41:56.670 --> 00:42:00.810
if I hurt someone for my own happiness,

00:42:02.080 --> 00:42:05.450
this harm will eventually come back to me, right?

00:42:06.280 --> 00:42:08.080
I'll never be forgiven

00:42:08.080 --> 00:42:10.280
That's right

00:42:10.420 --> 00:42:14.260
You don't have to harm anyone to save yourself.

00:42:17.330 --> 00:42:19.630
However...

00:42:20.700 --> 00:42:25.340
I think you and I deserve some leniency

00:42:27.040 --> 00:42:29.470
We've been through a lot

00:42:29.470 --> 00:42:32.880
Scars on our wrists...

00:42:33.810 --> 00:42:35.810
We just want a piece of happiness

00:42:36.980 --> 00:42:40.850
which is barely enough to cover the scars

00:42:40.850 --> 00:42:44.820
I think we deserve forgiveness

00:42:44.820 --> 00:42:47.520
even if we behave a little selfishly

00:42:47.520 --> 00:42:49.420
I'll believe in it

00:43:06.320 --> 00:43:08.260
Could you bring this to my chambers?

00:43:08.830 --> 00:43:09.950
Yes

00:43:26.270 --> 00:43:30.140
In the end you went to him

00:43:31.960 --> 00:43:36.740
You said that wanting both you and the throne is greed

00:43:37.600 --> 00:43:39.400
Now you are the emperor's woman

00:43:40.590 --> 00:43:42.320
How can I accept this?

00:43:45.760 --> 00:43:48.000
He was honest with me

00:43:49.910 --> 00:43:53.970
He told me he didn't want to lose me or the throne

00:43:55.290 --> 00:43:58.180
He admitted everything, even his greed

00:44:00.580 --> 00:44:03.310
I had no choice, I tried to understand

00:44:07.740 --> 00:44:09.080
I've always been interested

00:44:09.770 --> 00:44:14.790
Why did you insist that I cannot be emperor?

00:44:15.850 --> 00:44:16.870
In your eyes...

00:44:18.060 --> 00:44:20.650
Didn't I look worthy?

00:44:20.650 --> 00:44:22.850
- That's not true
- What then?

00:44:29.890 --> 00:44:35.110
It is said that Prince Wang So was born under the emperor's star.

00:44:35.650 --> 00:44:37.720
Emperor Taejo knew about this too

00:44:39.480 --> 00:44:41.140
It's not your fault

00:44:44.450 --> 00:44:46.730
This is the natural course of things, fate

00:44:49.920 --> 00:44:51.130
Emperor's Star?

00:44:54.160 --> 00:44:56.230
All because of some star?

00:44:58.220 --> 00:44:59.560
The natural course of things?

00:45:01.300 --> 00:45:02.530
Fate?

00:45:11.320 --> 00:45:13.600
When I see you I

00:45:15.100 --> 00:45:18.410
I can’t breathe, I’m timid

00:45:18.600 --> 00:45:22.200
It's as if everything in the world has stopped

00:45:22.780 --> 00:45:24.180
Can you promise me?

00:45:24.500 --> 00:45:29.100
If I pass by like a breeze,

00:45:26.250 --> 00:45:27.690
That you'll never take it off?

00:45:29.100 --> 00:45:32.200
you won't even notice

00:45:32.900 --> 00:45:37.500
My heart is all given to you

00:45:39.400 --> 00:45:45.500
But loving you is very painful for me

00:45:45.500 --> 00:45:47.700
And so sad

00:45:47.700 --> 00:45:52.200
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:45:52.750 --> 00:45:54.260
It's not your fault

00:45:53.500 --> 00:45:55.100
so hard

00:45:54.760 --> 00:45:57.080
This is the natural course of things, fate

00:45:57.300 --> 00:46:01.400
Don't forget, please!

00:46:02.270 --> 00:46:06.700
That eternal love

00:46:07.320 --> 00:46:09.320
mine

00:46:16.320 --> 00:46:19.990
You will become an empress

00:46:23.910 --> 00:46:26.650
Will you help me?

00:46:28.570 --> 00:46:32.920
Nobody can have everything

00:46:34.780 --> 00:46:36.990
Would that be fair?

00:46:46.100 --> 00:46:49.170
It happened that I would reach the very sources of the stream,
Sitting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance

00:46:49.170 --> 00:46:50.510
Done

00:46:58.330 --> 00:47:00.450
Why did you need me to write so much?

00:47:00.450 --> 00:47:02.800
I have a reason for this

00:47:04.980 --> 00:47:07.350
You said that there would be something prepared for me in your chambers

00:47:07.350 --> 00:47:08.940
It was just rice

00:47:09.860 --> 00:47:13.000
You ate it without leaving a grain

00:47:13.000 --> 00:47:16.940
I was going to give some to Baek Ah and astronomer Chi Mon

00:47:17.490 --> 00:47:20.190
You don't have to think about anyone but me

00:47:22.730 --> 00:47:23.830
It's all mine

00:47:29.030 --> 00:47:31.030
Did something happen today?

00:47:32.380 --> 00:47:34.840
No, why do you think that?

00:47:36.800 --> 00:47:38.930
You smile more than usual

00:47:40.010 --> 00:47:41.780
I'm worried, that's all

00:47:48.880 --> 00:47:51.370
Don't try to know everything about me

00:47:52.830 --> 00:47:57.110
If you keep acting like this when we're not even married, I'm going to want to run away.

00:47:57.110 --> 00:48:00.400
It's because I've been waiting all day for you, Your Majesty.

00:48:01.730 --> 00:48:04.880
Can I work in Damiwon during the day?

00:48:06.040 --> 00:48:09.820
Even if I can't serve myself,
there are many other things I can do

00:48:13.710 --> 00:48:17.360
And regarding Chae Ryung...

00:48:18.360 --> 00:48:21.210
I heard she was released from her job in Damiwon

00:48:21.210 --> 00:48:23.730
Can you let her stay?

00:48:25.970 --> 00:48:28.860
She has nowhere to go even if she leaves the palace

00:48:31.000 --> 00:48:32.290
Chae Ryung?

00:48:33.800 --> 00:48:35.100
I don't know

00:48:35.100 --> 00:48:37.820
I need her so I don't feel alone

00:48:37.820 --> 00:48:39.820
Huh? A?

00:48:43.840 --> 00:48:45.270
Okay, okay

00:48:47.070 --> 00:48:51.470
But... I don't think you'll be lonely in the future

00:48:54.550 --> 00:48:56.430
We will need to give birth to children and raise them

00:48:58.650 --> 00:48:59.980
D-children?

00:49:03.980 --> 00:49:05.890
The doctor will come to examine you

00:49:05.890 --> 00:49:08.850
You need to take care of your physical health to have children.

00:49:10.210 --> 00:49:12.340
We're not even married yet

00:49:12.340 --> 00:49:15.090
And you tell me to take care of my health and think about the children

00:49:15.090 --> 00:49:18.130
Marriage? We can get married

00:49:18.130 --> 00:49:19.480
When should we do this?

00:49:20.350 --> 00:49:21.890
Let's get married whenever you want

00:49:23.070 --> 00:49:25.640
No I don't want to

00:49:26.730 --> 00:49:31.530
Am I not only in your heart?

00:49:27.040 --> 00:49:28.110
Don't you want to?

00:49:29.150 --> 00:49:31.480
You need to make me an offer

00:49:31.530 --> 00:49:36.150
If I can do what I want

00:49:32.860 --> 00:49:37.060
You wanted to talk to me near the prayer towers

00:49:36.150 --> 00:49:40.440
I don't have to worry and wait

00:49:39.930 --> 00:49:41.470
Do you think I'm stupid?

00:49:40.440 --> 00:49:43.600
I want to make you mine

00:49:42.080 --> 00:49:44.140
You were going to propose to me there, weren't you?

00:49:46.780 --> 00:49:49.270
I don't know when I can get there

00:49:50.190 --> 00:49:52.760
Now it's not so easy for me to leave the palace

00:49:55.150 --> 00:49:56.240
Clear

00:49:59.500 --> 00:50:03.990
Should I propose so that you will be satisfied and marry me?

00:50:03.510 --> 00:50:08.270
I always laugh just like that, remembering you

00:50:07.170 --> 00:50:10.450
It's harder to do business with you,
than to decide the state

00:50:08.330 --> 00:50:14.070
I wonder if love has come to me?

00:50:14.220 --> 00:50:17.670
Even the sun and the moon

00:50:17.670 --> 00:50:21.580
They don't know my feelings

00:50:21.580 --> 00:50:22.920
To be with you

00:50:35.730 --> 00:50:39.390
Whatever you want to say
can you be honest with me

00:50:40.300 --> 00:50:43.870
I will tell everything to the emperor myself.

00:50:43.870 --> 00:50:47.260
Your knee still hasn't healed

00:50:47.740 --> 00:50:53.790
He was not treated properly after the torture, it developed into a chronic illness

00:50:54.060 --> 00:50:57.750
One day you may lose the ability to walk

00:50:57.750 --> 00:50:58.780
Clear

00:50:59.590 --> 00:51:01.460
I'll be careful

00:51:02.610 --> 00:51:04.970
However, there is something worse than this

00:51:05.860 --> 00:51:07.170
Rapid heartbeat

00:51:08.340 --> 00:51:10.020
Rapid heartbeat?

00:51:10.100 --> 00:51:14.320
When you are stressed or scared,
do you feel pressure in the chest area?

00:51:14.320 --> 00:51:18.500
Have you ever felt out of breath
to the point of fainting?

00:51:18.500 --> 00:51:19.880
Well, yes...

00:51:19.880 --> 00:51:21.900
You are very depressed

00:51:22.540 --> 00:51:25.950
The illness of your soul has become a physical illness

00:51:26.500 --> 00:51:32.450
Now I can't say for sure
how long will you live

00:51:34.770 --> 00:51:36.790
Can't you vouch?

00:51:40.200 --> 00:51:42.110
Will I not live long?

00:51:49.430 --> 00:51:50.860
I'm fine

00:51:51.920 --> 00:51:55.210
Please tell me how long I can live

00:52:10.180 --> 00:52:12.890
Now I will take good care of my health

00:52:14.710 --> 00:52:16.460
But I'm only in my 20s

00:52:18.380 --> 00:52:20.320
The most is 10 years

00:52:22.510 --> 00:52:23.960
I'll live a little longer

00:52:27.670 --> 00:52:28.750
With him...

00:52:32.060 --> 00:52:34.580
I want to stay with him a little longer

00:52:44.960 --> 00:52:46.820
What do you want so badly?

00:52:49.850 --> 00:52:53.470
Praying that So will remain on the throne for a long time?

00:52:54.660 --> 00:53:00.640
I ask that the brave and kind 14th Prince become my friend again

00:53:01.660 --> 00:53:04.460
You said you never
you won't take anyone's side

00:53:05.370 --> 00:53:07.380
However, you took the side of my 4th brother

00:53:07.380 --> 00:53:08.980
I feel betrayed

00:53:11.580 --> 00:53:13.900
Don't misdirect your anger

00:53:13.900 --> 00:53:18.550
Have you forgotten what the last emperor did to your elder brother and the 10th prince?

00:53:20.400 --> 00:53:25.100
It was obvious that So would become emperor

00:53:27.270 --> 00:53:30.070
Yeah, you must be right

00:53:30.070 --> 00:53:35.730
But I still think that everything has gone completely wrong since Seo came to Songak

00:53:36.420 --> 00:53:38.450
The struggle for the throne has always existed

00:53:38.450 --> 00:53:41.950
As soon as So entered it,
she became even more confused and ruthless

00:53:41.950 --> 00:53:43.970
Besides, the truth is that he stole the throne

00:53:45.550 --> 00:53:47.960
I'm worried that everyone will be in danger

00:53:49.280 --> 00:53:52.600
Don't you think you can become an empress?

00:53:55.310 --> 00:53:56.670
Empress?

00:54:00.180 --> 00:54:01.360
I don't know

00:54:02.620 --> 00:54:05.100
I haven't thought about it properly

00:54:05.100 --> 00:54:10.730
The Empress must use her clan and other clans to support the Emperor

00:54:10.730 --> 00:54:14.590
This is why Emperor Taejo had so many marriages

00:54:15.670 --> 00:54:20.670
Under these conditions, you will be just one of the emperor's many women.

00:54:20.670 --> 00:54:22.970
Is this how you wanted to live your life?

00:54:22.970 --> 00:54:27.140
What about camel riding in the desert?
and travel to the ocean to distant lands?

00:54:27.140 --> 00:54:28.550
Isn't this what you were talking about?

00:54:34.300 --> 00:54:36.730
When you get tired of this place, tell me

00:54:37.870 --> 00:54:39.460
If you really want to leave...

00:54:40.570 --> 00:54:42.650
I know the way

00:54:44.520 --> 00:54:46.120
I'll remember this

00:55:11.660 --> 00:55:14.980
Emperor, the 8th Prince wishes to see you

00:55:25.900 --> 00:55:27.010
Say what you want

00:55:28.310 --> 00:55:31.350
I am here on behalf of all your subjects

00:55:34.280 --> 00:55:35.960
Can you imagine them?

00:55:35.960 --> 00:55:37.000
First

00:55:39.460 --> 00:55:42.890
As for the leader of the 300,000-strong army,

00:55:42.890 --> 00:55:46.320
they would like to be the only ones
who has the right to vote for who they will be

00:55:46.980 --> 00:55:48.050
Second

00:55:48.710 --> 00:55:52.090
Needless to say, they will also levy a tax on grain

00:55:53.200 --> 00:55:55.630
If you let every area

00:55:55.630 --> 00:55:59.260
collect taxes due to the palace,

00:56:02.320 --> 00:56:05.590
you won't sit here alone like you do now

00:56:05.590 --> 00:56:08.060
So, distancing me from the army and the treasury,

00:56:09.330 --> 00:56:11.860
you want to cut off both the emperor's wings

00:56:14.090 --> 00:56:16.880
If you thought trying to put pressure on me like this would work,

00:56:17.950 --> 00:56:19.160
you were wrong

00:56:20.320 --> 00:56:22.310
If you don't want to lose your wings...

00:56:24.550 --> 00:56:26.220
What about your heart?

00:56:28.150 --> 00:56:31.990
Your Majesty, Hwangbo Clan of Hwangju
wanted to ask for marriage with you

00:56:41.580 --> 00:56:43.040
Beautiful chambers

00:56:43.740 --> 00:56:44.940
You arranged everything perfectly

00:56:44.940 --> 00:56:47.510
Please tell me what you came for

00:56:48.080 --> 00:56:49.940
I will listen to you, but only today

00:56:51.220 --> 00:56:53.320
I didn't come to fight

00:56:55.420 --> 00:56:59.030
I want to clarify what each of us wants

00:56:59.030 --> 00:57:02.550
I didn't think there was anything we could give or take from each other

00:57:03.930 --> 00:57:07.850
I don't need anything from you, princess

00:57:07.850 --> 00:57:11.440
You can stay here if you want

00:57:11.440 --> 00:57:14.360
I recognize you as the emperor's woman

00:57:14.910 --> 00:57:17.600
Still, you will not become a noble concubine

00:57:17.600 --> 00:57:21.800
I'm not going to be interested in who will take care of the emperor day and night

00:57:23.570 --> 00:57:25.330
I don't understand

00:57:26.650 --> 00:57:28.140
what do you want to say

00:57:28.140 --> 00:57:30.590
Honor and recognition - that's what I want

00:57:31.200 --> 00:57:34.780
I also want to see my son on the throne

00:57:36.940 --> 00:57:39.500
I will marry the emperor

00:57:40.540 --> 00:57:42.550
I will become his wife

00:57:46.690 --> 00:57:50.200
I will be the empress

00:57:55.890 --> 00:58:00.460
If you marry Yong Hwa,
all clans will be on your side

00:58:01.600 --> 00:58:03.940
The Hwangbo clan will be your support

00:58:03.940 --> 00:58:06.240
Don't try to shake me like that

00:58:06.870 --> 00:58:08.510
Yes, I'm sitting on the throne

00:58:09.260 --> 00:58:11.960
but I still have the temperament of a wolfhound

00:58:13.350 --> 00:58:17.630
You occupy a position that is hard to get and even harder to defend.

00:58:19.160 --> 00:58:22.640
Sitting on the throne, you will clearly understand

00:58:22.640 --> 00:58:25.790
that powerful clans are both good and bad at the same time

00:58:27.700 --> 00:58:29.980
If you want to sit on the throne for a long time,

00:58:29.980 --> 00:58:31.960
you need these families to be on your side

00:58:39.070 --> 00:58:41.800
I promised to marry someone else

00:58:43.250 --> 00:58:45.230
Do you mean Hae Soo?

00:58:47.500 --> 00:58:51.540
This girl can't become empress

00:58:55.680 --> 00:58:57.270
If I said I would...

00:58:58.810 --> 00:58:59.910
I'll do it

00:58:59.910 --> 00:59:01.460
You must have forgotten

00:59:02.210 --> 00:59:06.180
To avoid marriage with Emperor Taejo,

00:59:07.470 --> 00:59:09.410
she cut her hand

00:59:12.080 --> 00:59:13.870
A woman with a scar on her body...

00:59:15.180 --> 00:59:17.730
cannot become the emperor's wife

00:59:29.780 --> 00:59:36.120
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:29.780 --> 00:59:36.120
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:36.420 --> 00:59:39.320
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:39.480 --> 00:59:41.760
You must defend your throne

00:59:41.760 --> 00:59:45.580
I will make our son the next emperor

00:59:45.580 --> 00:59:50.260
How dare he use the throne as bait and play with me?

00:59:48.170 --> 00:59:54.470
You may suddenly pass by and not notice, have you forgotten me?

00:59:50.520 --> 00:59:51.970
You can't go anywhere

00:59:51.970 --> 00:59:54.770
You are my only empress

00:59:54.470 --> 01:00:01.470
But until you remember me, I will wait for you

00:59:54.770 --> 00:59:56.500
Please refuse to marry the emperor

00:59:56.500 --> 00:59:57.740
You have to let him go first

00:59:57.740 --> 00:59:59.740
What should I do?

00:59:59.740 --> 01:00:02.010
I ended up becoming a monster in Su's eyes

01:00:01.770 --> 01:00:08.270
At the same time, in the same place we will always be

01:00:02.010 --> 01:00:04.340
I will never forgive him for this
